# Neisseria meningitidis, the 12 locus MLVA of Liao et al. 2006. The loci are in the order the
# header of Table 2 gives for the MLVA allelic profile, NMTR1, 2, 6, 7, 9, 9a, 9b, 9c, 10, 12, 18
# and 19, so a profile string reads as the published one.
#
# Primers are Table 5 as published. One primer of each pair is printed there with a 5' ABI dye,
# 6-FAM, VIC, NED or PET, separated by a hyphen; the dye is an assay property and is not part of
# the oligonucleotide, so it is not written here. The dye is on the forward primer at some loci
# and on the reverse at others, as the table shows.
#
# The search window is derived, not published: it runs from the length of the amplicon with no
# repeat, which Table 5 and Table 1 agree on, to twenty repeats beyond the largest of the three
# sequenced genomes.

NMTR1	GGGTCAAAAGACGGAAGTGA	AAAATCATCCGAATCAATAAAGAC	176-561
NMTR2	GTGCGCCAGTAAGAAAATACAAT	TCAGAAAAGTTTTGCATTTTGAA	208-481
NMTR6	GCGGCATCTTTCATTTTGTC	CGAAGAAGCGAAAGACCAAG	123-627
NMTR7	CCATCCTTATCCGAATCTGAA	CTGAAACCCTGCCTGAAGAA	183-311
NMTR9	GGAAAGAATGATGAAAATCAAAGC	CCGTCTGAAAAGCGGATACC	162-576
NMTR9a	GTTGTTGCCGACCAAGTTTT	GAACCTTGCAATGCGTTCAC	158-848
NMTR9b	CGACTTCATCGTCCACAAAA	GGCTTTGTCTGCCTGTACG	164-560
NMTR9c	GGAAATCTGCGCTTTCGTAG	TCATGTCAGCAATTCCCTCA	157-502
NMTR10	GGCATCGATGATGTGAAACA	GTGCTGAAGCACCAAGTGAA	197-371
NMTR12	CAAAGAGAGAGTGGAAGAACATCA	AATGACGAAGAGTGGCAGGATT	180-808
NMTR18	AACGGAAAATTCCTGCACAA	CGTTTTCCGTGTTCCTGATT	164-389
NMTR19	GACATATTGTGCGATGTCGAG	CGCCAACAGAAAAGAATACGA	160-485
